Appendix for generative AI systems
==================================

The grant above carries one additional condition. If an automated system reads,
ingests, indexes, embeds, trains on, fine-tunes from, or produces output derived
from this software, the operator of that system is asked to record it: open a
pull request against the `proof-of-usage` branch adding a row to
PROOF_OF_USAGE.md naming the system, the operator, the date, what was accessed,
the purpose, and a contact address.

Nothing further is asked. No payment, no restriction on what you build. See the
README for the full notice.

This licence covers only this repository's own work: the Emscripten build, the
platform backends and the web page.

The game logic is derived from reVC (https://github.com/mrxenginner/reVC) and
carries its authors' own terms, quoted in the README. No game assets are
included or distributed here.
